(599,'fr','apropos.cta.title','Envie de <em>faire partie</em> de l\'aventure ?'),(600,'fr','apropos.cta.sub','Rejoignez une communauté qui transforme ses objets — et ses habitudes. C\'est gratuit.'),(601,'fr','apropos.mission.eyebrow','Notre mission'),(602,'fr','apropos.team.role_design','Design & Produit'),(603,'fr','apropos.commit.heading','Des principes, pas des promesses'),(604,'fr','apropos.cta.pro','Découvrir les offres Pro'),(605,'fr','apropos.mission.p1','Chaque année, des tonnes de matériaux et d\'objets en bon état finissent à la déchèterie, faute d\'avoir trouvé preneur. <strong>Notre rôle, c\'est de créer le lien manquant</strong> entre celles et ceux qui donnent, vendent, réparent et réinventent.'),(606,'fr','apropos.values.durability_title','Durabilité'),(607,'fr','apropos.team.role_ceo','Cofondatrice & CEO'),(608,'fr','apropos.team.role_cto','Cofondateur & CTO'),(609,'fr','apropos.hero.title','Moins de déchets, <em>plus de liens.</em>'),(610,'fr','apropos.history.heading','Notre histoire'),(611,'fr','apropos.history.y1_title','L\'idée'),(612,'fr','apropos.history.y3_desc','UpcycleConnect s\'ouvre au public et fédère une communauté grandissante autour du réemploi et de l\'upcycling.'),(613,'fr','apropos.team.eyebrow','Les visages derrière le projet'),(614,'fr','apropos.commit.c1_desc','Chaque dépôt est contrôlé par notre équipe avant publication.'),(615,'fr','apropos.mission.quote','« Rien ne se perd, <em>tout se transforme</em> — il suffisait d\'une plateforme pour le rendre possible. »'),(616,'fr','apropos.mission.heading','Donner une seconde vie, à grande échelle'),(617,'fr','apropos.values.proximity_title','Proximité'),(618,'fr','apropos.history.y1_desc','Un constat partagé : trop d\'objets en bon état partent à la benne alors qu\'ils pourraient resservir. On esquisse les premières maquettes.'),(619,'fr','apropos.history.y3_title','L\'ouverture'),(620,'fr','apropos.team.sub','Une petite équipe pluridisciplinaire, animée par la même envie de réduire le gaspillage.'),(621,'fr','apropos.commit.c3_title','Circuit court'),(622,'fr','apropos.hero.desc','UpcycleConnect est née d\'une conviction simple : un objet qui ne sert plus à quelqu\'un peut transformer le quotidien d\'un autre. Nous bâtissons la plateforme qui rend l\'économie circulaire évidente, locale et accessible à tous.'),(623,'fr','apropos.mission.cta_join','Rejoindre la communauté'),(624,'fr','apropos.mission.cta_explore','Explorer le marché'),(625,'fr','apropos.values.heading','Nos valeurs'),(626,'fr','apropos.values.community_desc','Des particuliers et des artisans qui s\'entraident, partagent et créent du lien local.'),(627,'fr','apropos.history.y2_desc','Lancement d\'une bêta avec une poignée d\'artisans et de particuliers engagés. On affine la plateforme à leurs côtés, échange après échange.'),(628,'fr','apropos.commit.c2_desc','Aucune commission sur les objets donnés. Donner ne coûtera jamais rien.'),(629,'fr','apropos.mission.sign','— L\'équipe UpcycleConnect'),(630,'fr','apropos.values.community_title','Communauté'),(631,'en','apropos.hero.desc','UpcycleConnect was born from a simple conviction: an item that is no longer useful to someone can transform someone else\'s daily life. We are building the platform that makes the circular economy obvious, local and accessible to all.'),(632,'en','apropos.mission.eyebrow','Our mission'),(633,'en','apropos.mission.p2','By connecting individuals and artisans around upcycling, we want to make reuse <strong>as simple as buying new</strong> — while keeping value, know-how and resources in our regions.'),(634,'en','apropos.values.eyebrow','What guides us'),(635,'en','apropos.values.durability_title','Sustainability'),(636,'en','apropos.history.y2_title','First steps'),(637,'en','apropos.team.sub','A small multidisciplinary team, driven by the same desire to reduce waste.'),(638,'en','apropos.commit.c3_desc','Local, in-person exchanges to limit the transport footprint.'),(639,'en','apropos.values.community_title','Community'),(640,'en','apropos.history.y1_desc','A shared observation: too many items in good condition end up in the bin when they could be reused. We sketch the first mockups.'),(641,'en','apropos.commit.heading','Principles, not promises'),(642,'en','apropos.cta.title','Want to <em>be part</em> of the adventure?'),(643,'en','apropos.hero.eyebrow','Our story'),(644,'en','apropos.mission.quote','\"Nothing is lost, <em>everything is transformed</em> — all it took was a platform to make it possible.\"'),(645,'en','apropos.mission.heading','Giving a second life, at scale'),(646,'en','apropos.values.heading','Our values'),(647,'en','apropos.values.sub','Four principles that guide every one of our decisions, from product to community.'),(648,'en','apropos.values.transparency_desc','Verified listings, clear profiles, trusted exchanges. Nothing to hide.'),(649,'en','apropos.commit.c2_desc','No commission on donated items. Giving will never cost anything.'),(650,'en','apropos.commit.c3_title','Short supply chain'),(651,'en','apropos.values.transparency_title','Transparency'),(652,'en','apropos.history.y2_desc','Launch of a beta with a handful of committed artisans and individuals. We refine the platform alongside them, exchange after exchange.'),(653,'en','apropos.team.heading','The team'),(654,'en','apropos.commit.c1_desc','Every submission is reviewed by our team before publication.'),(655,'en','apropos.cta.register','Create an account'),(656,'en','apropos.cta.pro','Discover the Pro plans'),(657,'en','apropos.mission.sign','— The UpcycleConnect team'),(658,'en','apropos.mission.p1','Every year, tons of materials and items in good condition end up at the dump for lack of a taker. <strong>Our role is to create the missing link</strong> between those who give, sell, repair and reinvent.'),(659,'en','apropos.team.role_cto','Co-founder & CTO'),(660,'en','apropos.team.role_design','Design & Product'),(661,'en','landing.nav.home','Home'),(662,'en','apropos.mission.cta_join','Join the community'),(663,'en','apropos.mission.cta_explore','Explore the marketplace'),(664,'en','apropos.values.community_desc','Individuals and artisans who help each other, share and build local connections.'),(665,'en','apropos.values.proximity_desc','Short supply chains first: we favor exchanges close to you.'),(666,'en','apropos.history.y1_title','The idea'),(667,'en','apropos.history.y3_title','The opening'),(668,'en','apropos.history.y3_desc','UpcycleConnect opens to the public and brings together a growing community around reuse and upcycling.'),(669,'en','apropos.values.durability_desc','Extending the life of items above all. Every exchange saves a wasted resource.'),(670,'en','apropos.history.heading','Our story'),(671,'en','apropos.team.eyebrow','The faces behind the project'),(672,'en','apropos.team.role_ceo','Co-founder & CEO'),(673,'en','apropos.commit.c2_title','Donations stay free'),(674,'en','apropos.commit.eyebrow','Our commitments'),(675,'en','apropos.commit.c1_title','Verified listings'),(676,'en','apropos.cta.sub','Join a community that transforms its items — and its habits. It\'s free.'),(677,'en','apropos.hero.title','Less waste, <em>more connections.</em>'),(678,'en','apropos.values.proximity_title','Proximity'),(679,'en','apropos.history.eyebrow','The road traveled'),(680,'fr','annonce.card.see','Voir l\'annonce →'),(681,'fr','annonce.sort.price_desc','Prix décroissant'),(682,'fr','annonce.card.good_condition','Bon état'),(683,'fr','annonce.cat.textile','Textile'),(684,'fr','annonce.cat.electronics','Électronique'),(685,'fr','annonce.sort.price_asc','Prix croissant'),(686,'fr','annonce.nav.listings','Annonces'),(687,'fr','annonce.search.button','Rechercher'),(688,'fr','annonce.filter.all_m','Tous'),(689,'fr','annonce.filter.type_title','Type'),(690,'fr','annonce.hero.title','Annonces'),(691,'fr','annonce.cat.furniture','Mobilier'),(692,'fr','annonce.empty.title','Aucune annonce validée'),(693,'fr','annonce.nav.back','← Retour'),(694,'f